+## Supported currencies
+
+tally can accept expenses in these currencies:
+
+| Code | Currency        |
+|------|-----------------|
+| USD  | US Dollar       |
+| EUR  | Euro            |
+| GBP  | British Pound   |
+| SGD  | Singapore Dollar|
+| JPY  | Japanese Yen    |
+| INR  | Indian Rupee    |
+
+All amounts are converted to USD at the fixed rates in `tally/rates.py` and stored in dollars.
+
 ## A note on scope
 
 This is a personal tool, not an accounting package. It does not do tax categories,
